        "title": "Sobrescritura de Método",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 150033,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Supongamos que estamos construyendo un juego de arcade simple con un enemigo básico y un enemigo jefe más difícil. Los jefes son enemigos especiales con un comportamiento diferente.</p><p>Ahí es donde <strong>la sobrescritura de métodos</strong> resulta útil.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 150034,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podemos crear una clase <code>Enemy</code> y hacer que una clase <code>Boss</code> la extienda.</p><p>Luego, usando la sobrescritura de métodos, podemos cambiar el comportamiento de daño de la clase <code>Boss</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 150035,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sobrescribir un método reemplaza el código del método en la superclase con el de la subclase.</p><p>Llama al método <code>takeHit()</code> de la clase <code>Boss</code> para ver qué le sucede a la propiedad <code>hp</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"252\" endIndex=\"256\" /><option startIndex=\"256\" endIndex=\"257\" /><option startIndex=\"257\" endIndex=\"266\" /><option startIndex=\"266\" endIndex=\"267\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(sprite) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".sprite = sprite;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp - \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Boss\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp - \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" boss = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Boss(\" /><text value=\"&quot;boss.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(boss.hp);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"boss.takeHit();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(boss.hp);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>boss</code> seguido de <code>.</code> y luego <code>takeHit()</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 150036,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para sobrescribir un método, le damos el <em>mismo</em> nombre y parámetros que el método en la superclase.</p><p>Podemos sobrescribir <code>takeHit()</code> de la superclase codificando el mismo método en la subclase.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"153\" endIndex=\"162\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(sprite) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".sprite = sprite;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp - \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Boss\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp - \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" boss = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Boss(\" /><text value=\"&quot;boss.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(boss.hp);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"boss.takeHit();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(boss.hp);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>takeHit()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 150037,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sobrescribir significa que podemos tener el <em>mismo método</em> en la subclase pero <em>personalizar</em> su comportamiento para lo que se necesita en la subclase.</p><p>Cuando llamamos al método <code>takeHit()</code> en <code>enemy</code> y <code>boss</code> veremos su comportamiento similar pero resultados diferentes.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"233\" endIndex=\"238\" /><option startIndex=\"239\" endIndex=\"248\" /><option startIndex=\"308\" endIndex=\"312\" /><option startIndex=\"313\" endIndex=\"322\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(sprite) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".sprite = sprite;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp - \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Boss\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp - \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Enemy(\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"enemy.takeHit();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemy.hp);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" boss = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Boss(\" /><text value=\"&quot;boss.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"boss.takeHit();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(boss.hp);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>enemy</code> seguido de <code>takeHit()</code> y luego <code>boss</code>, <code>takeHit()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 150038,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Si necesitamos el comportamiento del método de la superclase, podemos llamarlo con la palabra clave <code>super</code>.</p><p>Escribe la palabra clave correcta para llamar al método <code>attack()</code> de la clase Enemy.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"191\" endIndex=\"196\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(weapon) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".weapon = weapon;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy attacks with &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".weapon);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Boss\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"super\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".attack();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" boss = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Boss(\" /><text value=\"&quot;claws&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"boss.attack();}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>super</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 150039,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Al sobrescribir, podemos construir sobre el comportamiento de la subclase. Después de realizar un ataque normal, un jefe puede desencadenar un movimiento especial.</p><p>Agrega un comportamiento específico del jefe al método <code>attack()</code> de la clase <code>Boss</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"209\" endIndex=\"220\" /><option startIndex=\"221\" endIndex=\"243\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(weapon) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".weapon = weapon;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy attacks with &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".weapon);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Boss\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"super\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".attack();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Boss uses Mega Slam!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" boss = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Boss(\" /><text value=\"&quot;claws&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"boss.attack();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>console.log</code> seguido de <code>\"Boss uses Mega Slam!\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 150040,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Por qué querríamos que un método en una subclase sobrescriba un método de una superclase?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Para personalizar el método en la subclase</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Para cambiar el método de la superclase para las subclases</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Para personalizar el método en la subclase.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 150041,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué necesita tener en común el método de la subclase con el método de la superclase al sobrescribirlo?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">El nombre y los parámetros</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">El cuerpo del método</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">El nombre y los parámetros.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 150042,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿El método en la clase <code>Bat</code> está sobrescribiendo el método de la clase <code>Enemy</code>?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack(target) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hit &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + target);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Bat\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" bite(target) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (target === \" /><text value=\"&quot;player&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hit &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + target);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">No, tiene un nombre diferente</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Sí, tiene el mismo parámetro</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">No, tiene un nombre diferente.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 150043,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué palabra clave usamos cuando llamamos al método de una superclase en la subclase?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>super</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>this</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>super</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 150044,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Puede una subclase seguir usando el método original de la superclase, una vez que lo sobrescribe?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">No, al llamar a ese método por su nombre sin <code>super</code>, la subclase usará el método de sobrescritura</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Sí, la subclase utiliza el método de la superclase por defecto, incluso después de sobrescribirlo</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">No, al llamar a ese método por su nombre sin <code>super</code>, la subclase usará el método de sobrescritura.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 150045,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sobrescribe <code>draw()</code> de la superclase codificando el mismo método en la subclase.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"107\" /><option startIndex=\"107\" endIndex=\"109\" /><option startIndex=\"110\" endIndex=\"111\" /><option startIndex=\"157\" endIndex=\"158\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Sprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" draw() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Drawing sprite.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"AnimatedSprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Sprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" draw() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Playing animation frames.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sprite1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" AnimatedSprite();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"sprite1.draw();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>draw</code> seguido de <code>()</code> y luego <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 150046,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Llama al método <code>draw()</code> en la instancia de <code>AnimatedSprite</code> para ver qué sucede.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"200\" endIndex=\"215\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Sprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" draw() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Drawing sprite.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"AnimatedSprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Sprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" draw() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Playing animation frames.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" mySprite = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" AnimatedSprite();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"mySprite.draw();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>mySprite.draw()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
